[00:16.52]1. Something precious to Jehovah,
[00:21.12]Bringing him such keen delight,
[00:25.14]Is his Kingdom by Christ Jesus,
[00:29.78]Which will set all matters right.
[00:34.46](Chorus)
[00:34.58]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[00:39.14]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[00:43.62]Sing his praise among the nations,
[00:48.28]Serving him in faithfulness.
[01:04.74]2. Why be anxious for tomorrow,
[01:09.02]‘Will we hunger, will we thirst?’
[01:14.00]For our God will make provision
[01:18.16]If we seek his Kingdom first.
[01:23.04](Chorus)
[01:23.18]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[01:27.84]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[01:32.68]Sing his praise among the nations,
[01:37.50]Serving him in faithfulness.
[01:55.58]3. So declare the Kingdom good news;
[01:59.78]Help deserving ones to see
[02:04.50]That their hope is in Jehovah
[02:09.22]And in his Theocracy.
[02:16.08](Chorus)
[02:16.74]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[02:21.70]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[02:27.50]Sing his praise among the nations,
[02:32.70]Serving him in faithfulness.
